@startuml
!include _astyle.iuml
title 5.9  AOG / ROA / Critical Priority Handling (QP.56) — Activity
|Customer / CPU|
start
:Upgrade component status to AOG / ROA / Critical;
|Mgr PC / CsE|
:Identify item (P/N, description, serial) in COL;
:Insert AOG/ROA column — status, quantity, date;
|CoE / Unit PCD|
if (Critical, suffix 'K'?) then (yes)
  :HOB identify repair location; upgrade repair priority;
else (no)
endif
if (Spares required?) then (yes)
  :Route to CoE/Unit repair, OV, POOLEX or AW spares;
  :Hasten repair / supplier; monitor progress & EDD;
else (no)
  :Unit proceed repair; expedite if serviceable;
endif
|Mgr PC / CsE|
:Advise CAO / CPU on EDD & delivery;
if (Serviceable?) then (yes)
  |CoE / Unit PCD|
  :Stamp AOG/ROA on Serviceable Tag (F111);
  |Central / Unit Logistic|
  :Expedite delivery (temporary F218) per QP.51;
  :Relay Delivery Note ref & actual date;
  |Mgr PC / CsE|
  :On confirmation — set COL AOG/ROA column 'closed' + date;
  stop
else (no)
  :Continue hastening repair;
  stop
endif
@enduml
